# Data and planning apps

Five small apps handle records, forms, dates, tasks and files. They all have a #G.bottle(Share) tab with **Share & Chat**, and they all use the same three [layouts](#/layouts)!


::divider{wavy|Data and planning apps|cyan}
## Mainkey: records

#PR#Database#= [Open Mainkey](/mainkey)

Build your own fields, then keep records in them. Search, filter and sort in a #PR.bottle(Table), or browse a #PR.bottle(Gallery) with live statistics!

* #R.flag(Home) has New Record, Add Field, the Table and Gallery views, and Sort By!
* #O.flag(Data) imports and exports `.kb` files and exports `.csv`, and has Demo Data and Clear All!
* #GL.flag(Share) has a #PR.bottle(Website Kit) and #PR.bottle(Host), which can serve the database straight from your browser tab so others can open it!

## Formly: forms

#PR#Forms#= [Open Formly](/formly)

Build a form with #Y.bottle(New Form) and #Y.bottle(Add Field), flip between #Y.bottle(Builder) and #Y.bottle(Preview), and share it as a file:

* `.kfe` is an #Y.bottle(editable) form, so the other person can change it!
* `.kfv` is a #Y.bottle(viewable) form that people fill in!
* `.kfa` holds the #Y.bottle(answers)!

Question text accepts Keydown, so chips and highlights work in forms. Share & Chat lets a group edit a form together!

## Hexa: calendar and boards

#G#Calendar#= [Open Hexa](/hexa)

* #TU.bubble(Calendar) shows months and an agenda for events. #C.bottle(Today) and #C.bottle(Year) jump around!
* #T.bubble(Boards) are columns of cards: #C.bottle(New Board), #C.bottle(New Column) and #C.bottle(New Card)!
* #C.bubble(Import and export) standard `.ics` files (so you can swap with other calendars) and Hexa's own `.kh` files!

## Taskra: to-do lists

#C#Todo#= [Open Taskra](/taskra)

Tasks have priorities and due dates. Filter with #O.bottle(All Tasks), #O.bottle(Active), #O.bottle(Done) and #O.bottle(Overdue), and use #O.bottle(Clear Completed) to tidy up. Lists import and export as `.tk` files!

## Cabinet: drive

#R#Drive#= [Open Cabinet](/cabinet)

Keep files in #TU.bottle(drawers), like a file explorer. #TU.bottle(New Drawer), #TU.bottle(New Folder) and #TU.bottle(Upload Files) are on the Home tab, and #TU.bottle(Cards) or #TU.bottle(List) views are in View. A whole drive downloads at once as a ZIP, and the Share tab can save a drawer as a `.kc` or `.zip` file!
